WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00.900 --> 00:02.900
The future is uncertain.

2
00:03.000 --> 00:05.026
But it is certainly digital.

3
00:05.200 --> 00:13.754
Advances in climate science, medicine, engineering,
art and entertainment are all driven by advances in data, analytics and technology.

4
00:15.300 --> 00:21.897
Digital technologies are becoming more intertwined,
reinforcing one another and opening up new opportunities.

5
00:22.900 --> 00:27.865
Many of the things we do every day were
science fiction only a generation ago.

6
00:28.500 --> 00:30.823
Think of self-driving cars.

7
00:31.000 --> 00:39.500
Innovations in sensor technology, cloud storage and artificial intelligence
are making autonomous driving and connected traffic a reality.

8
00:39.600 --> 00:44.088
Think of the lives that could be saved,
and the carbon emissions that could be cut.

9
00:46.000 --> 00:48.890
Change is happening faster and faster.

10
00:50.200 --> 00:59.200
What stays the same is how important it is to invest in the human abilities that
let us work with emerging technologies ethically, creatively and sustainably.

11
00:59.300 --> 01:04.372
With autonomous vehicles, people have to decide
how much autonomy the car should have.

12
01:05.300 --> 01:09.678
People write the policies on privacy, safety and accountability.

13
01:11.200 --> 01:17.575
To answer the complex questions the digital world raises,
you need to keep building your knowledge and your skills.

14
01:18.700 --> 01:24.310
But your digital toolkit also needs the mindsets
that will let you succeed in a dynamic era.

15
01:26.000 --> 01:32.198
When surprising new technologies emerge and new skills are needed,
how you approach the challenge is what counts.

16
01:34.600 --> 01:40.425
Curiosity counts. Ask questions,
challenge constraints, and build on what you already know.

17
01:40.800 --> 01:46.900
Embrace iteration. Treat what you do as something that
can keep improving with feedback and new insight.

18
01:47.000 --> 01:50.200
See the world as a place of boundless abundance.

19
01:50.300 --> 01:55.263
Seek new opportunities, share what you know with colleagues,
and learn with your community.

20
01:56.400 --> 01:59.636
Imagine how you could make these mindsets your own.

21
02:00.000 --> 02:04.851
When you face unexpected change in your world,
how will you answer the call to act?

22
02:06.400 --> 02:08.403
What choices will you make?
